---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout active="/">
  <div class="page-shell">
    <section class="hero">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow">Sichuan University Photography Association</div>
        <h1 class="display">SCU<br/>LENS</h1>
        <div class="hero-index">Chengdu · Student Photography Community</div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <div class="feature-card">
          <span class="num">01 / ONLINE ARCHIVE</span>
          <div>
            <h2>把光留下来。</h2>
            <p>四川大学摄影协会的线上影像空间。作品、活动、校园与人的片段，会从这里慢慢累积起来。</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="section-title">
        <h2>正在发生</h2>
        <p>静态站第一阶段先记录可长期保存的内容：活动、作品与社团信息。投稿和后台将在下一阶段接入。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid-3">
        <a class="story-card" href="/gallery">
          <div class="meta"><span>ARCHIVE</span><span>01</span></div>
          <div><h3>成员作品</h3><p>按主题与时间整理摄影作品，让照片本身成为网站的主体。</p></div>
        </a>
        <a class="story-card" href="/events">
          <div class="meta"><span>EVENTS</span><span>02</span></div>
          <div><h3>活动记录</h3><p>讲座、外拍、比赛、迎新与社团共同经历的现场档案。</p></div>
        </a>
        <a class="story-card" href="/about">
          <div class="meta"><span>ABOUT</span><span>03</span></div>
          <div><h3>关于摄协</h3><p>组织介绍、部门分工、指导教师与加入我们的长期入口。</p></div>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section manifesto">
      <div class="eyebrow">Our point of view</div>
      <div>
        <blockquote>不是把每一刻都拍下来，<br/>而是知道<em>为什么按下快门。</em></blockquote>
        <p class="copy">QQ 频道继续承担高频图片交流；官网负责整理、策展和长期留存。等内容规模真正需要时，再接入动态投稿、成员账户和服务器。</p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
